{"question": "Keep the same definitions, but combine the tenured and tenure-track counts and show only full professors.", "seconds": 34.495879800000694, "intent": "analyze", "message": "Using Single combined ladder (tenured + tenure-track) full-professor count at Southern Connecticut State University, plus average salary for the Professor rank. Ladder faculty is defined here as tenured plus on-tenure-track with faculty status; IPEDS has no such category. The two statuses are disjoint, so adding them is valid. Count is Fall 2024 (Nov 1) and covers degree-granting institution staff. Population includes non-ladder professors; this is not a ladder salary, since IPEDS has no salary by tenure status. Academic year 2024-25 versus the Fall 2024 count; no cross-panel arithmetic.", "usage": {"model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "calls": 6, "planning_tool_requests": 7, "semantic_repair_attempts": 0, "latency_seconds": 28.32579930000659, "input_tokens": 129265, "output_tokens": 3514, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0, "cache_read_input_tokens": 62568, "estimated_api_usd": 0.29992679999999994, "pricing_basis": "Existing configured standard token-cost estimate; catalog planning may require multiple calls.", "stages": [{"input_tokens": 563, "output_tokens": 53, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0, "cache_read_input_tokens": 0, "calls": 1, "latency_seconds": 1.7511103000142612, "estimated_api_usd": 0.001656, "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "stage": "institution mention extraction"}, {"model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "calls": 5, "planning_tool_requests": 7, "semantic_repair_attempts": 0, "latency_seconds": 26.57468899999233, "input_tokens": 128702, "output_tokens": 3461, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0, "cache_read_input_tokens": 62568, "estimated_api_usd": 0.29827079999999995, "pricing_basis": "Existing configured standard token-cost estimate; catalog planning may require multiple calls.", "stages": [{"input_tokens": 16081, "output_tokens": 284, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0, "cache_read_input